n  \n    <body>\n\n    <div id=\"menu\" class=\"container-fluid d-flex justify-content-center\n        align-items-center  topMenu\">\n        \n   </div> \n  \n       \n    <!-- display images , audio  -->\n    <div class=\"container-fluid\">\n        <div class=\"row \">\n            <div class=\"col-md-8\">\n                    \n                    <div id=\"buttonContainer\" class=\"container-fluid mb-5 d-flex \n                                    align-items-center justify-content-center\">\n                                <div class=\" d-flex\"></div>                         \n                                <div class=\" d-flex\"></div>                         \n                                <div class=\" d-flex\"></div>                         \n                                                                                \n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"container text-center text-light mt-4\">\n                        <h3 class=\"text-center\">HOW IT WORKS</h3>\n                        <p style=\"font-size: 15px;\">\n                               To put on test the power that nature, music and motivational words have, to potentially shaping aspects of our personalities<br> \n                               I have displayed list of 30 landscape images \n                               Each image is combined with a melodie and motivational/emotional/Fantasied quotes <br>\n                               your task is to Select 4 images that reflect your inner feelings , the ones that have the most effect on you<br> \n                               I will determine your personality type based on your selection\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div id=\"main\" class=\"container-fluid d-flex d-flex flex-column justify-content-start\"> \n                        <div id=\"imgDisplayer\" class=\"container-fluid mt-4\n                            gap-3 d-flex flex-wrap justify-content-evenly \">\n                            <div class=\"container-fluid text-light align-items-center\">\n                                \n                            </div>   \n                        </div> \n                        \n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"container-fluid text-center text-light mt-4\">\n                        <h3 style=\"color:rgb(9, 180, 241);\">Personality vs Nature </h3>\n                        <p style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Certain aspects of personality show significant correlation with landscape preferences: people classified as less \n                            “emotionally stable” prefer those landscapes containing structural rhythms and recurrent “patterns”, even sacrificing\n                            the universally accepted quality of vegetation spontaneity and vigour. People with high scores with regard to “sense of \n                            responsibility” tend to reject hostile, defoliated or wintery landscapes, despite their greater legibility. These facts \n                            confirm previous results concerning personality-landscape preference relationships, and coincide with the ample bibliography\n                            available in relation to personality and aesthetic judgement in general. The affective system brought into play in landscape\n                            appraisal is a consequence of wider personal strategies concerning an individual's attitude towards the world and his fellow\n                            human beings. The conclusion reached is that the environmental perception of others deserves respect in the planning process.\n                        </p>\n                        <h3 style=\"color:rgb(8, 128, 234);\">Personality vs Music</h3>\n                        <p style=\"font-size: 16px;\" id=\"inroductionText\">\n                             Personality and music preferences are complexly related,\n                             and there are many factors that can influence how people experience \n                             music and the world around them\n                             Music can influence how people experience nature, such as when relaxing music enhances\n                             the experience of viewing a landscape from a car. Music can also change how people \n                             perceive urban environments, and the arousal levels in music can alter how people perceive outdoor environments\n                        </p>\n\n                    </div>\n                               \n               \n            </div> \n            <div class=\"col-md-4 \">\n                 <div class=\"container-fluid d-flex flex-column justify-content-center align-items-center\">\n                    <div id=\"selection\" class=\"container-fluid  gap-4 d-flex flex-wrap align-items-center \n                        justify-content-start\">\n                        <div style=\"background-color: aliceblue;\" class=\"container-fluid d-flex justify-content-center align-items-center\">\n                            <h3>Your Selection</h3>\n                        </div>\n\n                    </div>\n                    <div id=\"register\" class=\"container-fluid text-center mb-5\">\n                        <p style=\"color:rgb(243, 246, 248);font-size: 16px;\">must Register to get result, please Register Below </p>\n                        <button id=\"registerButton\" style=\"width: 70%;height: 50px;font-size: 18px;border: none;border-radius: 10px;\n                        color:white; background-color: rgb(43, 203, 21);margin-top: 20px;\">REGISTER</button>\n                    </div>\n                    \n                    <div class=\"container-fluid \">\n                        \n                        <form id=\"form\">\n                            <div class=\"mt-5 mb-4 text-center text-center\"><h3 class=\"text-light\">Register</h3></div>\n                            <div id=\"personality\" class=\"dropdown mt-5\">\n                                <button class=\"btn btn-secondary dropdown-toggle\" type=\"button\" id=\"dropdownMenuButton\" data-toggle=\"dropdown\" aria-haspopup=\"true\" aria-expanded=\"false\">\n                                  Personlity type\n                                </button>\n                                <div class=\"dropdown-menu\" aria-labelledby=\"dropdownMenuButton\">\n                                  <p class=\"dropdown-item\" href=\"#\">ERT</p>\n                                  <p class=\"dropdown-item\" href=\"#\">prtv</p>\n                                  <p class=\"dropdown-item\" href=\"#\">dvsdfsd</p>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                          \n                          <div class=\"mb-4 mt-5\">\n                            <input type=\"text\" class=\"form-control\" name=\"username\" id=\"username\" placeholder=\"username\" required=\"\">\n                          </div>\n                          <div class=\"mb-4 mt-5\">\n                            <input type=\"email\" class=\"form-control\" name=\"email\" id=\"email\" placeholder=\"email\" required=\"\">\n                            <div id=\"emailHelp\" class=\"form-text text-light\">We'll never share your email with anyone else.</div>\n                          </div>\n                          <div class=\"mb-4 mt-5\">\n                            <input type=\"password\" class=\"form-control\" name=\"password\" id=\"password\" placeholder=\"Password\" required=\"\">\n                          </div>\n                          <div class=\"mb-4 mt-5\">\n                            <input type=\"password\" class=\"form-control\" name=\"confirmpassword\" id=\"confirmpassword\" placeholder=\"Confirm Password\" required=\"\">\n                          </div>\n                         \n                          <button class=\"mt-5 mb-5\" type=\"submit\" value=\"Submit\">Submit</button>